---
// Notificação Toast Global Flutuante
---
<div 
  id="global-toast" 
  class="fixed bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md shadow-2xl opacity-0 pointer-events-none translate-y-3 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2.5 z-50 max-w-[92vw] sm:max-w-md md:max-w-lg border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md"
  role="status" 
  aria-live="polite"
>
  <span id="global-toast-icon" class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-tertiary-fixed shrink-0">check_circle</span>
  <span id="global-toast-text" class="text-sm font-medium leading-snug break-words">Ação executada com sucesso!</span>
</div>
